flowchart TD
 A[Training run + artifact] --> MR[Immutable model registry]
 B[Prompt template + variables] --> PR[Immutable prompt registry]
 MR --> V[Digest and provenance verification]
 PR --> V
 V --> C[Compatibility validator]
 E[Evaluation report + safety evidence] --> RB[Release bundle manifest]
 C --> RB
 RB --> H{Independent approval}
 H -->|Rejected or missing| Q[Candidate blocked]
 H -->|Approved exact manifest hash| G{Release manager RBAC}
 G -->|Denied| Q
 G -->|Allowed| CAS[Alias compare-and-swap]
 CAS --> ST[Staging alias]
 ST --> P[Production alias]
 P --> R[Serving runtime resolves complete bundle]
 R --> M[Loaded digest and version telemetry]
 P -->|Canary regression| Rollback[Rollback alias to previous approved bundle]
 Rollback --> R
 CAS --> Audit[Append-only audit and alias history]
 Rollback --> Audit
